### Trademark & Brand Notice
"Aurelia Palace" is an open architectural template brand created by ha-re-ram for
demonstrating luxury hospitality web experiences, animation systems, and interactive
booking workflows. All associated vector crests, layouts, and motion systems are
free to use and adapt for personal, portfolio, and commercial client projects.
